{{!
    @template mod_playercross/words_status_ok

    Teacher-only reassurance shown instead of mod_playercross/inactive_words when the
    approved pool has no word missing from either role — same alert-box treatment
    (outside and above the game card, same spacing) but in the "info" colour rather
    than "warning", since there is nothing here that needs the teacher's attention.
    Never rendered for a student — gated by canmanage in view_page_service.php.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "activewordscountterm": "5 words active as a term.",
        "activewordscounttheme": "6 words active as the theme concept."
    }
}}
<div class="mod-playercross-words-status alert alert-info mb-3">
    <p class="mb-1"><strong>{{activewordscountterm}}</strong></p>
    <p class="mb-0"><strong>{{activewordscounttheme}}</strong></p>
</div>
